{
  "source": "..\\api\\speech.md",
  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "语音 (Speech)",
      "name": "语音_(speech)",
      "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>speech</code> 与 <code>$speech</code> 是同一 Rhino 全局对象, 由兼容且已启用的 3-Macaw Speech 插件提供离线语音识别, 语音活动检测, 唤醒词和神经网络合成. 相关模型存放在插件私有目录. 宿主不提供缺少插件时的替代识别引擎.</p>\n<p>本页对应当前宿主的 <code>Speech</code>, <code>SpeechModels</code>, <code>SpeechSession</code>, <code>SpeechWakeSession</code> 与协议 V1. Node.js 和 Bun 尚无对应的 <code>speech</code> 模块或全局对象, 不应根据 Rhino 的补全提示推断可用性.</p>\n<p>麦克风由插件采集, 需要插件获得麦克风权限. 文件路径相对脚本工作目录解析, 也可使用绝对路径; 不接受 <code>content://</code>, <code>file://</code>, <code>http://</code> 等 URI. 错误由 <code>SpeechError</code> 表示.</p>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] isAvailable",
          "name": "[m]_isavailable",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.isAvailable()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "isAvailable",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) } - 当前是否有兼容且已启用的插件应答. ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [boolean](dataTypes#boolean) ",
                      "desc": "当前是否有兼容且已启用的插件应答."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": []
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>该探测不抛出插件错误. 返回 <code>true</code> 不表示所有模型都已安装或麦克风权限已授予.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] isAvailable"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] capabilities",
          "name": "[m]_capabilities",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.capabilities()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "capabilities",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { [object](dataTypes#object) } - 当前插件能力快照. ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " [object](dataTypes#object) ",
                      "desc": "当前插件能力快照."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": []
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>返回字段包括 <code>contractVersion</code>, <code>features</code>, <code>catalogVersion</code>, <code>engineName</code>, <code>engineVersion</code>, <code>ttsEnginePackage</code>, <code>microphoneGranted</code>, <code>packageName</code>, <code>versionName</code>, <code>versionCode</code>. 可选插件信息可以为 <code>null</code>. <code>features</code> 可能包含 <code>asr</code>, <code>asrStreaming</code>, <code>vad</code>, <code>kws</code>, <code>tts</code>, <code>ttsSystemEngine</code>, <code>models</code>, 应根据实际返回值判断能力.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] capabilities"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] listen",
          "name": "[m]_listen",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.listen(options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "listen",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ options ]** { [object](dataTypes#object) } - 听写选项, 见下表. ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "options ]** { [object](dataTypes#object) } - 听写选项, 见下表."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { SpeechSession } - 持续到 `end` 事件的会话. ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " SpeechSession ",
                      "desc": "持续到 `end` 事件的会话."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>默认值与含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>model</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>省略时使用相应默认模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>language</code></td>\n<td>string</td>\n<td>可选语言标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source</code></td>\n<td>`&#39;mic&#39; \\</td>\n<td>&#39;external&#39;`</td>\n<td><code>&#39;mic&#39;</code>, 麦克风或外部 PCM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sampleRate</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>16000, 会话只接受此采样率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vad</code></td>\n<td>boolean</td>\n<td><code>true</code>, 使用语音活动检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>silenceEndMillis</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>1200, 范围 1..60000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>maxDurationMillis</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>300000, 正整数且不超过 1800000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>timeoutMillis</code></td>\n<td>number</td>\n<td>15000, 范围 0..1800000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hotwords</code></td>\n<td>string[]</td>\n<td>空数组, 最多 200 项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>punctuation</code></td>\n<td>boolean</td>\n<td><code>true</code>, 启用标点处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let session = speech.listen({ language: &#39;zh&#39;, maxDurationMillis: 10000 });\nsession.on(&#39;final&#39;, event =&gt; console.log(event.text));\nsession.on(&#39;error&#39;, error =&gt; console.error(error.code, error.message));\nsession.on(&#39;end&#39;, event =&gt; console.log(event.reason, session.result()));\n</code></pre>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] listen"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] recognize",
          "name": "[m]_recognize",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.recognize(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "recognize",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>source</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | ArrayBuffer | ArrayBufferView | Java byte[] } - WAV 路径或 PCM 数据.</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <code>model</code>, <code>language</code>, <code>hotwords</code>, <code>punctuation</code>, <code>vad</code>, <code>sampleRate</code>.</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - 识别结果.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PCM 采用单声道 PCM16 LE, <code>sampleRate</code> 默认 16000, 可为 8000..192000. <code>punctuation</code> 与 <code>vad</code> 默认 <code>true</code>. WAV 文件读取其文件头中的采样率. 不接受普通 JavaScript 数字数组代替 Java <code>byte[]</code>; 可传入 <code>Int16Array</code> 或 <code>files.readBytes</code> 得到的字节数组.</p>\n<p>结果包含 <code>text</code>, <code>segments</code>, <code>durationMillis</code>, <code>modelId</code>, <code>warnings</code>. 每个语音段含 <code>startMillis</code>, <code>endMillis</code>, <code>text</code>, 并可能带 <code>language</code> 与 <code>tags</code> (<code>emotion</code>, <code>event</code>). <code>warnings</code> 为 <code>{ code, message }</code> 数组.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] recognize"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] recognizeAsync",
          "name": "[m]_recognizeasync",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.recognizeAsync(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "recognizeAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<p>参数与 <code>recognize</code> 相同, 返回解析为相同结果对象的 Promise. 在 UI 线程上应使用此形式, 错误通过 Promise 拒绝传递.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] recognizeAsync"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] detectVoice",
          "name": "[m]_detectvoice",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.detectVoice(source, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "detectVoice",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>source</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | ArrayBuffer | ArrayBufferView | Java byte[] } - 与 <code>recognize</code> 相同的音频来源.</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <code>model</code>, <code>sampleRate</code>, <code>threshold</code>, <code>minSpeechMillis</code>, <code>minSilenceMillis</code>.</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <code>{ segments, durationMillis }</code>, 每段含 <code>startMillis</code>, <code>endMillis</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>threshold</code> 为 0..1, 两个最小时间为 0..1800000 毫秒. 省略时由所选模型使用默认值. 该方法同步执行, 当前没有 <code>detectVoiceAsync</code> 入口.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "source"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] detectVoice"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] wake",
          "name": "[m]_wake",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.wake(keywords, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "wake",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**keywords** { [string](dataTypes#string) | [object](dataTypes#object) | [Array](dataTypes#array) } - 一个关键词, 或由字符串及 `{ keyword, boost?, threshold? }` 组成的数组. ",
                      "name": "**keywords**",
                      "type": " [string](dataTypes#string) | [object](dataTypes#object) | [Array](dataTypes#array) ",
                      "desc": "一个关键词, 或由字符串及 `{ keyword, boost?, threshold? }` 组成的数组."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "**[ options ]** { [object](dataTypes#object) } - `model`, `minIntervalMillis`, `thenListen`. ",
                      "name": "**[",
                      "desc": "options ]** { [object](dataTypes#object) } - `model`, `minIntervalMillis`, `thenListen`."
                    },
                    {
                      "textRaw": "<ins>**returns**</ins> { SpeechWakeSession } - 唤醒会话. ",
                      "name": "<ins>**returns**</ins>",
                      "type": " SpeechWakeSession ",
                      "desc": "唤醒会话."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "keywords"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "desc": "<p>关键词为 1..50 个且不可重复. <code>boost</code> 范围 -100..100, <code>threshold</code> 范围 0..1. <code>minIntervalMillis</code> 默认 1500, 范围 0..600000.</p>\n<p><code>thenListen</code> 可以为布尔值或听写选项. 为 <code>true</code> 时使用默认听写设置; 使用对象时只能选择麦克风来源, 不能设为 <code>&#39;external&#39;</code>. 每次 <code>wake</code> 事件的 <code>listen</code> 字段携带该次命中后的听写会话. 停止唤醒会话也会结束正在进行的听写轮次.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] wake"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] synthesize",
          "name": "[m]_synthesize",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.synthesize(text, path, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "synthesize",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>text</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 非空文本, 最多 8000 字符.</li>\n<li><strong>path</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 输出 WAV 文件路径.</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <code>model</code>, <code>speaker</code>, <code>speed</code>, <code>format</code>.</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <code>{ path, sampleRate, durationMillis, modelId, speakerId, sizeBytes, warnings }</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>speaker</code> 可以是说话人 ID 或名称; <code>speed</code> 范围 0.5..2, <code>format</code> 仅支持 <code>&#39;wav&#39;</code>. 插件负责合成, 宿主发布输出文件. <code>speakerId</code> 是数值 ID.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] synthesize"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] synthesizeAsync",
          "name": "[m]_synthesizeasync",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.synthesizeAsync(text, path, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "synthesizeAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<p>参数与 <code>synthesize</code> 相同, 返回解析为相同文件结果对象的 Promise, 可在 UI 线程使用.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] synthesizeAsync"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] speak",
          "name": "[m]_speak",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "speech.speak(text, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "speak",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>text</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 要播放的文本.</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#object\">object</a> } - <code>model</code>, <code>speaker</code>, <code>speed</code> 及允许的 <a href=\"tts\">TTS 选项</a>.</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { Promise } - 与 <code>tts()</code> 相同的播放结果.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>该调用使用 3-Macaw Speech 的系统 TTS 引擎. 不接受 <code>engine</code>, <code>voice</code>, <code>rate</code>, <code>speechRate</code>; 用 <code>model</code> / <code>speaker</code> 选择声音, 用 <code>speed</code> 选择语速. <code>speaker</code> 需要同时指定 <code>model</code>. 缺少插件时 Promise 以 <code>PLUGIN_UNAVAILABLE</code> 拒绝.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] speak"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p+] models",
          "name": "[p+]_models",
          "desc": "<p><code>speech.models</code> 管理插件的模型目录和已安装模型. 模型类型为 <code>&#39;asr&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;tts&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;kws&#39;</code>, <code>&#39;vad&#39;</code>. 模型对象包含 <code>id</code>, <code>kind</code>, <code>modelType</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>languages</code>, <code>sizeBytes</code>, <code>installed</code>, <code>isDefault</code>, <code>recommended</code>, <code>version</code>, <code>source</code>, <code>license</code>; 已安装模型可带 <code>installedBytes</code>, TTS 模型可带 <code>speakers</code> 和 <code>sampleRate</code>.</p>\n",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "models.list(filter?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "list",
              "desc": "<p>返回模型对象数组. 可按 <code>kind</code>, <code>language</code>, <code>installed</code> 过滤.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "filter?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "models.install(id, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "install",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<p>下载并安装目录中的模型, 返回模型对象. 选项包括 <code>acceptLicense</code> (默认 <code>false</code>) 和 <code>onProgress(done, total)</code>. 非商用模型需要明确接受许可; 此选项不改变模型许可本身. 进度回调在脚本线程执行.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "id"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "models.installAsync(id, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "installAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>install</code> 的 Promise 形式, 可在 UI 线程使用.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "id"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "models.importFile(path, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "importFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<p>导入脚本可读取的本地模型归档, 返回模型对象. 选项包括 <code>id</code>, <code>kind</code>, <code>modelType</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>languages</code>, <code>acceptLicense</code>, <code>onProgress</code>. 不支持 URI 路径.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "path"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "models.remove(id)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "remove",
              "desc": "<p>删除已安装模型, 返回是否实际删除的布尔值.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "id"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "models.setDefault(kind, id)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "setDefault",
              "desc": "<p>设置该类型的默认模型, 返回模型对象.</p>\n",
