            {
              "textRaw": "models.refreshCatalog()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "refreshCatalog",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<p>刷新签名模型目录, 返回 <code>{ version, updated }</code>. 当前没有异步别名, 不应在 UI 线程调用.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
